{"kind": "mod", "id": 934, "name": "Search Open Containers", "slug": "search-open-containers", "teaser": "Allow searching open containers without needing to close them first", "owner_name": "DrakiaXYZ", "downloads": 172429, "favourites": 162, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "xyz.drakia.searchopencontainers", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-03T06:02:27.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-06-20T04:25:45.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-06-20T04:25:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.5.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Have you ever run across an open filing cabinet, and questioned why a trained PMC operative needs to close a drawer just to open it again before being able to look inside it?</p>\n<p>No more! SPT now has the most highly trained PMC operatives, who know how to look in open drawers (And all other lootable containers)!</p>\n<p>In simple terms, this mod allows using the “Search” action on any container that is already opened, without needing to close it first.</p>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>1) Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</p>\n<p>2) Select the folders in the zip file in 7-zip</p>\n<p>3) Drag the selected folders from 7-zip into your SPT folder</p>\n<p>Demonstration Video (Yes, it’s Quest Tracker, but the same concept applies to all of my mods, I’m not making mod-specific extraction example videos):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afNPjAw.gif\" alt=\"Install Gif\" /></p>\n<h3>Usage</h3>\n<p>Use the standard interaction menu on open containers, the default option will now be “Search”</p>\n<h3>Special Thanks</h3>\n<p>Special thanks to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/30408-gaylatea/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Gaylatea</a> for her <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1264-use-loose-loot/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Use Loose Loot</a> mod that reminded me I wanted to make this, and for the general area of code to start looking in!</p>\n<p>If you enjoy my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/drakiaxyz\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">feed my caffeine addiction</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 33110, "published_at": "2023-10-08T20:40:28.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/934/search-open-containers/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 23207, "published_at": "2024-07-06T19:19:41.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/934/search-open-containers/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 19514, "published_at": "2024-11-27T05:15:51.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/934/search-open-containers/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 33485, "published_at": "2025-03-15T20:00:33.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/934/search-open-containers/1.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.4.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 4061, 